# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Pre-Phase-B historic untracked noise (B7 audit follow-up).
# These directories accumulated during V1 / V3.5 / Phase 0 / Phase A
# work; they are not part of the BOS v9 mainline and never enter
# the Phase B audit chain. Ignoring keeps `git status` focused on
# the actual working set. Remove an entry below if you actively
# resume work in that area.
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Agent / skills runtime workspaces (pre-Phase-B brainstorming).
.agents/

# Phase 0 / Phase 0.5 inventories and gap analyses (historical).
_reports/PHASE_0_5_*.md
_reports/BOS_Phase0_*.md
_reports/_phase_b_paper_extract.txt

# V3.5 / V1 stabilisation smoke logs + screenshots (historical).
reports/stabilize-v9/
reports/benchmark-runs/
reports/codex-login-check/
reports/github-radar/
reports/playwright-check/
reports/runtime-staging/
reports/runtime-write-probe.tmp
reports/release-readiness-summary.json
reports/release-readiness-summary.md
reports/bos-code-claw-*.md

# Benchmark / docs scaffolding from earlier batches (not Phase B output).
benchmark_tasks/
docs/
scripts/

# Top-level historic notes (kept locally; not part of the Phase B
# audit chain — `BOS_Paper1_*` paper artefacts and `BOS_*BASELINE`
# / `BOS_*MATRIX` docs live next to the repo, not in it).
BOS_EXTERNAL_KNOWLEDGE_AND_DATA_MATRIX.md
BOS_V3_5_BASELINE_LOCK.md

# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Paper 1 submission readiness audit (Phase B handoff additions)
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Env-var variants beyond .env / .env.local / .env.production
.env.*
.envrc
*.env.secret

# Secret-bearing JSON / YAML that occasionally lands in scratch dirs
*secrets*.json
*secrets*.yaml
*secrets*.yml
credentials.json
credentials.yaml

# Operator-side patch scratch (created during paper-pin re-pin work)
*_pre-patch-*.docx
*_post-patch-*.docx
*.docx.tmp

# Local scratch / handoff draft directories at repo root (paper-side
# drafts live in Paper1_BT/_drafts/ which is outside the repo)
_drafts/
_scratch/
